==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}}, from {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|descomforter|lang=fro}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/dɪsˈkʌmfət/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/dIs"kVmf@t/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/dɪsˈkʌmfɚt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/dIs"kVmf@`t/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Mental or bodily [[distress]].
# Something that disturbs one’s comfort; an annoyance.
