===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To cause [[annoyance]] or [[distress]].

====Usage notes====
As a verb, the unrelated term {{term|discomfit|lang=en}} is often used instead, largely interchangeably, though this is proscribed by some as an error, {{term||discomfit}} originally meaning “destroy”, not “distress”.

